# Machine-local configuration
# variables/*.yaml holds user-specific configuration (subscription-scoped object IDs, naming,
# regions, SKUs) and must never be committed. Only the *.yaml.example templates are tracked.
# Any new configuration YAML added to this repository must follow the same rule.
variables/*.yaml
!variables/*.yaml.example

